OL,3,GNEWSAAthletes urged to apply for #100k
OL,4,Asupport fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FAthletes have been urged to apply for
OL,7,Ffunds to help them develop and compete
OL,8,Fat international events.
OL,10,FJersey Sport has opened applications
OL,11,Ffor its Performance Sport Programme,
OL,12,Fwith more than #100,000 available to
OL,13,Fsupport players, coaches and officials.
OL,15,FThe organisation said athletes who fell
OL,16,Finto "Podium, Podium Potential, Talent
OL,17,FPerformance and Talent ID profiles"
OL,18,Fwould be invited to apply for funding
OL,19,Fto support their training, competition
OL,20,Fand living costs.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
