OL,3,GNEWSAAthletes urged to apply for #100k
OL,4,Asupport fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FDom Blampied, from Jersey Sport, said
OL,7,Fhe was "proud" of the growth of the
OL,8,Fprogramme, which first launched in 2024
OL,9,Fand how it had helped sportspeople
OL,10,Fachieve their dreams.
